5595","id":3837708343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kvsg3","user":{"login":"snosrati200","id":242628136,"node_id":"U_kgDODnY2KA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242628136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200","html_url":"https://github.com/snosrati200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T22:58:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T22:58:55Z","body":"Thanks for the feedback @bsil78. It seems that while the code addresses the metadata handling, the underlying EditorFileSystem still doesn't consistently trigger the re-import for CSVs as expected. Since this appears to be a deeper engine/caching issue rather than just the importer logic, I'll step back for now so someone with deeper knowledge of the Godot FileWatcher can take a look. At least we've narrowed down where the detection fails.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837708343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4005254837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115595#issuecomment-4005254837","is